                <pb facs="0784" n="664" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg664"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Jackson to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Cettinje</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-10-31"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 31,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Presented credentials to-day. Prince requested me to express gratitude to
                    President. Propose leaving Friday for Greece via Italy. Wilson in charge at
                    Athens.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jackson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
